OL,3,GNEWSAMP harassed for 'being English' by
OL,4,Aman who took axe to pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who harassed a Labour MP for
OL,7,Fbeing "English", and claimed he knew
OL,8,Fwhere he lived, has been given a
OL,9,Fsuspended jail sentence.
OL,11,FMichael Glover, 59, left a note on Mid
OL,12,Fand South Pembrokeshire MP Henry
OL,13,FTufnell's office door in Haverfordwest,
OL,14,FPembrokeshire, on 10 March, and carried
OL,15,Fan axe to the pub the following day.
OL,17,FIn the letter, which he signed, he also
OL,18,Fwrote that he had taken "a look around"
OL,19,FTufnell's family home and had "left
OL,20,Fsome presents".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
