OL,3,GNEWSAMP harassed for 'being English' by
OL,4,Aman who took axe to pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MP said he felt "uneasy" that the
OL,7,Fdefendant said he knew where he lived
OL,8,Fwith his family, including his newborn
OL,9,Fbaby.
